     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Users from India who cannot pay via PayPal can raise a Manual Invoice Request to pay via UPI / NEFT/ IMPS",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/00778ed7789ad2fb.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "h3",
     "text": "How to make a manual invoice request?",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "17.3333px",
     "color": "rgb(208, 23, 82)",
     "anchor": "how-to-make-a-manual-invoice-request"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/971d79a8bbce61a8.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "I) Identify the product and plan that you want to purchase.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/a9b61a5dc0a2f998.png",
     "alt": "Map My Sheet"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Example: Form Director and Premium plan",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/7f49cd2470bcece1.png",
     "alt": "Cloud Flow Director"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "II) Goto pricing page on the product website",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/790b1d69262fcd7d.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Example:",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/26194d490464fb74.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "For the Form Director product, the web page is https://formdirector.jivrus.com/pricing",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/57a7aa5d52a85c1d.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "For the Database Browser product, the web page is https://databasebrowser.jivrus.com/pricing",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/1ab5955f2dd574d1.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "III) Click on \"Request Manual Invoice\" on the identified plan on the Pricing Page",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/5c3865c2b0d7730c.jpg",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/abaa7e6dd355d010.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "See the sample below. You will notice \"Request Manual Invoice\" below \"Pay with PayPal\" button. You need to use that on the Pricing Page (not on the below image illustration)",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/eddfa642ff43bb00.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "IV) It will open Manual Invoice Request Form. Follow the Steps mentioned in the form",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/d65740251b10affb.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Steps mentioned in the Manual Invoice Request Form",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/9dfd24901330f45b.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Step 1: Fill this form with correct details and submit",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/8af98c637678e49a.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Step 2: You will get an email in a minute with payment instructions to pay via IMPS or UPI",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/2ec800085fb1b925.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Step 3: Make the payment",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/dd1d231ff120a3ec.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Step 4: Reply to the email with the screenshot of the payment",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/fa8641fd18cc5b8a.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Step 5: Jivrus Support team will provide the license and reply. Allow up to 1 business hour on weekdays and 4 business hours on weekends/holidays to process the payment. (Business hours is 9:00 AM to 6:30 PM, requests outside the business hours will be processed the next day)",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
